    {/* Legal & Regulatory Disclaimer */}
    <div class="bg-white border border-slate-200 rounded-xl p-4 mb-6 leading-relaxed text-[11px] text-slate-600 space-y-2 shadow-2xs">
      <div class="flex items-center gap-2 text-slate-900 font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-xs">
        <span>🛡️</span>
        <span>Independent 3rd-Party & Legal Advisory (স্বতন্ত্র ও আইনি বিজ্ঞপ্তি)</span>
      </div>
      <p>
        <strong>1. Independent Public Information Service:</strong> This portal (dearresultlive.in) is an independent, third-party informational news and archival platform. We are <strong>not affiliated, associated, authorized, endorsed by, or in any way officially connected</strong> with the Directorate of Nagaland State Lotteries, Directorate of Sikkim State Lotteries, Government of West Bengal, or any official state lottery organizing department.
      </p>
      <p>
        <strong>2. No Ticket Sales & Zero Wagering Policy:</strong> We strictly <strong>DO NOT SELL</strong> lottery tickets, do not accept bets, and do not facilitate any online or offline gambling transactions. Any unauthorized individual or entity claiming to represent this platform for ticket booking or prize guarantees is fraudulent.
      </p>
      <p>
        <strong>3. Mandatory Official Gazette Verification:</strong> While we endeavor to ensure 100% data integrity and instantaneous synchronization via edge automated OCR, all winning numbers, prize categories, and ticket validity <strong>must be cross-verified</strong> with the official physical Gazette notification published by the respective State Government Lottery Directorates.
      </p>
      <p>
        <strong>4. Age Advisory (18+ Only):</strong> State lotteries are strictly prohibited for minors under 18 years of age. Please check local jurisdiction regulations before participating in state-regulated paper lotteries.
      </p>
    </div>

    {/* Bottom Bar: Copyright & Attribution */}
    <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center justify-between gap-4 text-slate-500 text-[11px]">
      <div>
        © {currentYear} <strong>DEAR RESULT LIVE (dearresultlive.in)</strong>. All rights reserved.
      </div>
      <div class="flex items-center gap-4">
        <span>Nagaland & Sikkim State Lotteries Unofficial Archive</span>
        <span>•</span>
        <span>Fast Edge SSR</span>
      </div>
    </div>

  </div>
